==Description==
The '''Spirits Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained at Level 11 of the premium [[Null & Void Event#Null & Void Battle Pass|Null & Void Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{GumDrops|230}} or {{Robux|35}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{GumDrops|1,250}} or {{Robux|513}}. Prior to the 20% discount, it had a cost of {{Robux|44}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{Robux|648}}.

The '''Spirits Nametag''' has blue gradient text with a dark blue outline. Black and blue fog surrounds the text and various blue spirits come out of it.

